// Engine tag, with the reason measured rather than assumed (2026-08-21):
// under SOUNIO_SOUC_ENGINE=lean_single this file fails to typecheck with
//   error: unknown identifier `eb_new` at <main>:325
// lean_single cannot resolve the stdlib module this witness imports
// (stdlib/epistemic/beta_confidence.sio, added by the same PR). Madaros
